00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:05.260
Paul Lieberstein's office.
保罗·利伯斯坦的办公室里拍摄。

504
00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:06.200
Oh, okay.
哦，好的。

505
00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:10.700
Because that was the window that looked outside onto our parking lot and onto our street.
因为那扇窗户正好对着我们的停车场和街道。

506
00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:16.780
