00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:42.360
office, and then he whipped to a window that just had like a scrim behind it, right?
办公室，然后快速摇向一扇后面只有幕布的窗户，对吧？

516
00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:42.880
Because that's
因为那就是

