迈克尔办公室窗户的真实情况。

518
00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:45.560
Yeah, yeah.
对，没错。

519
00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:48.160
On our set, there's nothing behind his window.
在我们的片场，他窗户后面什么都没有。

520
00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:48.740
Yeah.
是的。

521
00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:48.790
Yeah.
没错。

522
00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:51.360
Then he went up to Paul Lieberstein's office.
然后他去了保罗·利伯斯坦的办公室。

523
00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:54.180
He did another whip and then had Steve
他又做了一次快速摇镜，然后让史蒂夫

524
00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:55.040
run by outside.
在外面跑过。

525
00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:58.220
And he did that thing where he cut in the whip and put it together.
他通过快速摇镜的剪辑把这些画面拼在了一起。

526
00:23:58.480 --> 00:24:00.100
That's movie magic, guys.
这就是电影魔术，伙计们。

527
00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:01.400
Movie magic.
电影魔术。

528
00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:06.060
Now, I guess everyone has decided they want to know how fast they can run.
现在，我想大家都决定要看看自己能跑多快。

529
00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:10.900
It feels like Michael has forced us all outside to run past the sign.
感觉就像迈克尔强迫我们所有人到外面去跑过那个标志牌。

530
00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:12.560
Dwight is very enthusiastic.
德怀特非常积极。

531
00:24:12.660 --> 00:24:14.380
He's happy to run past it.
他很乐意跑过去。

532
00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:18.080
He runs past and he gets a speed of 13 miles per hour.
他跑了过去，测出的速度是每小时13英里。

533
00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:18.900
Yes.
没错。

534
00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:24.200
Well, Jenna, do you notice how we're all just like, we're so cold and we're like, shivering.
好吧，珍娜，你注意到我们所有人看起来都冷得发抖了吗？

535
00:24:24.460 --> 00:24:26.900
But truly, the guys are like sweating their butts off.
但实际上，男士们都热得汗流浃背。

536
00:24:27.080 --> 00:24:27.440
Oh, yeah.
哦，确实。

537
00:24:27.460 --> 00:24:32.500
I went to, because I'm just an old lady who loves to know what the weather was.
我去查了查，因为我就是一个喜欢了解当时天气的“老太太”。

