如果你想知道任何地方的天气，打给我妈就行。

540
00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:42.760
She'll tell you.
她会告诉你的。

541
00:24:42.760 --> 00:24:54.720
So I dug into my digital clutter and found out, we shot this episode the week of October 13th in 2008, and the average temperature was in the 90s for this week.
所以我翻了翻我的数字记录，发现我们是在2008年10月13日那一周拍摄的这一集，那一周的平均气温在90多华氏度（约32摄氏度以上）。

542
00:24:54.920 --> 00:25:03.700
Randy told me that, yeah, not only was it over 90 degrees that day, but we had to schedule this scene to shoot right after lunch.
兰迪告诉我，那天不仅气温超过了90度，而且我们还不得不把这场戏安排在午饭后拍摄。

543
00:25:04.240 --> 00:25:05.580
Oh, gross.
哦，真糟糕。

544
00:25:06.240 --> 00:25:11.140
So we all had these full bellies and like the sun was right directly over us.
所以我们当时都吃得饱饱的，而且太阳就直射在我们头顶上。

545
00:25:11.140 --> 00:25:11.460
Yeah.
没错。

546
00:25:11.840 --> 00:25:15.540
But he said, luckily, it only took a couple of hours to shoot.
但他还说，幸运的是，这场戏只用了几个小时就拍完了。

547
00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:17.080
A couple of hours.
几个小时。

548
00:25:17.160 --> 00:25:18.800
Lucky for us.
我们真幸运。

549
00:25:20.100 --> 00:25:21.600
Oh, I always felt bad.
哦，我一直觉得很过意不去。

550
00:25:21.740 --> 00:25:25.380
This is the one moment I felt bad for the guys because we froze our butts
这是我唯一一次为男士们感到难过的时候，因为我们当时冷得要命

551
00:25:25.380 --> 00:25:26.480
off on the stage.
在舞台上的时候。

552
00:25:26.600 --> 00:25:27.340
The ladies did.
女士们确实穿得少。

553
00:25:27.520 --> 00:25:29.080
We were always in less clothing.
我们总是穿得更少。

554
00:25:29.260 --> 00:25:30.520
But then when we were in these
但当我们在拍摄这些

555
00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:35.660
parking lot scenes and they're in full suits and they're sweating their butts off.
停车场场景时，他们穿着全套西装，热得要命。

556
00:25:35.820 --> 00:25:37.800
And running with full stomachs of food.
而且还要吃饱了饭去跑。

557
00:25:38.360 --> 00:25:38.700
Ugh.
呃。

558
00:25:38.980 --> 00:25:42.920
I have to imagine we were pretty comfortable out there in that 90-degree parking lot.
我得说，在那个90华氏度（约32摄氏度）的停车场里，我们应该算是挺舒服的了。

559
00:25:43.020 --> 00:25:43.980
I was probably fine.
我大概还好。

560
00:25:44.120 --> 00:25:44.700
We were great.
我们感觉很棒。

561
00:25:45.060 --> 00:25:47.860
So it is hot, and they're running past this radar gun.
所以当时很热，他们跑过那个测速仪。

562
00:25:48.180 --> 00:25:51.280
You know, Dwight scored a 13, and Michael wants to beat it.
你知道，德怀特跑出了13英里的时速，迈克尔想超过他。

563
00:25:51.460 --> 00:25:57.000
And so he starts running again, and a car goes by, and all of a sudden Michael clocks 31.
于是他又开始跑，这时一辆车经过，迈克尔突然测出了31英里的时速。

564
00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:58.680
And he's like, yes!
他当时就说，耶！

565
00:25:58.920 --> 00:26:01.040
And everyone kind of calls BS on that.
大家都觉得他在胡扯。

566
00:26:01.480 --> 00:26:01.860
Yes.
没错。

567
00:26:02.080 --> 00:26:06.400
Well, we got a lot of questions about how did we technically pull this off, right,
嗯，我们收到了很多关于我们技术上是怎么实现这一点的提问，对吧，

568
00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:08.180
with these speed numbers.
关于这些速度数字。

569
00:26:08.520 --> 00:26:11.700
Randy shared with us that the machine just worked.
兰迪告诉我们，那台机器就是能正常工作。

570
00:26:11.720 --> 00:26:15.680
It was actually clocking people's real running speeds
它实际上测出了人们真实的跑步速度

571
00:26:15.680 --> 00:26:17.340
and the real car speed.
和真实的车辆速度。

572
00:26:17.520 --> 00:26:21.540
But then he shared with us the reason we did this cold open
但他还告诉我们，我们拍这个开场戏的原因

573
00:26:21.540 --> 00:26:23.960
was inspired by one of our writers,
是受到了我们其中一位编剧的启发，

574
00:26:24.300 --> 00:26:25.200
real life experience.
那是他的真实生活经历。

575
00:26:26.080 --> 00:26:28.560
Yes, Aaron Schurr, you guys,
是的，亚伦·舒尔，伙计们，

576
00:26:28.740 --> 00:26:30.380
Aaron Schurr is like always coming up
亚伦·舒尔总是能想出

577
00:26:30.380 --> 00:26:31.580
with these great cold opens.
这些很棒的开场戏。

578
00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:33.580
And I talked with him.
我和他聊过。

579
00:26:33.940 --> 00:26:36.120
He is so hilarious to me, Jenna,
他对我来说太搞笑了，珍娜，

