00:26:36.120 --> 00:26:38.900
because he's like, I guess my real life is just weird enough
因为他说，我猜我的真实生活就是足够奇怪，

581
00:26:38.900 --> 00:26:41.840
that it translates into a great cold open.
以至于能转化成一个很棒的开场戏。

582
00:26:42.300 --> 00:26:43.880
Prior to working on The Office,
在为《办公室》工作之前，

583
00:26:44.480 --> 00:26:47.940
Aaron had been working on The New Adventures of Old Christine.
亚伦曾在《俏妈新恋情》剧组工作。

584
00:26:47.980 --> 00:26:49.420
It was a show on CBS.
那是CBS电视台的一档节目。

585
00:26:49.840 --> 00:26:51.780
Yeah, with Julia Louis-Dreyfus.
对，就是朱莉娅·路易斯-德莱弗斯主演的那部。

586
00:26:52.120 --> 00:26:52.600
Exactly.
没错。

587
00:26:53.060 --> 00:26:54.960
They filmed on the Warner Brothers lot,
他们在华纳兄弟片场拍摄，

588
00:26:54.980 --> 00:26:57.480
and he said on the Warner Brothers lot,
他说在华纳兄弟片场里，

589
00:26:57.640 --> 00:26:59.020
