然后以最快的速度从旁边跑了过去。

596
00:27:17.750 --> 00:27:20.770
Surprisingly, it clocked 20 miles per hour.
令人惊讶的是，它显示是20英里每小时。

597
00:27:20.910 --> 00:27:21.730
That's his memory.
那是他的记忆。

598
00:27:22.030 --> 00:27:22.170
No.
不。

599
00:27:22.770 --> 00:27:24.050
That is his memory.
那就是他的记忆。

600
00:27:24.910 --> 00:27:28.070
He said other riders were like, wait, I want to try this.
他说其他编剧当时说，等等，我也想试试。

601
00:27:28.230 --> 00:27:31.150
They backed up and they started running past it as well.
他们退后几步，也开始从它旁边跑过去。

602
00:27:32.010 --> 00:27:36.250
And he said it was a very sweaty writer's room that afternoon.
他说那天下午编剧室里汗味很重。

603
00:27:37.110 --> 00:27:38.630
That is incredible.
太不可思议了。

604
00:27:39.030 --> 00:27:44.930
So he told this story when he came to the office, and they were like, oh my gosh, like, this
他来办公室讲了这个故事，大家听了都觉得，天哪，这

