00:27:57.190 --> 00:28:00.630
Well, I guess it was too tempting to ignore.
好吧，我想它太诱人了，让人无法忽视。

610
00:28:01.150 --> 00:28:01.810
Oh, no.
噢，不。

611
00:28:02.130 --> 00:28:09.010
Randy said that one day during lunch, a bunch of the riders went down and they started sprinting past it.
兰迪说有一天午餐时，一群编剧跑过去，开始冲刺经过它。

612
00:28:09.310 --> 00:28:10.710
Here we go again.
又来了。

613
00:28:11.210 --> 00:28:14.610
