00:28:16.190 --> 00:28:18.230
Remember our rider, Ryan Coe?
还记得我们的编剧瑞安·科吗？

616
00:28:18.550 --> 00:28:19.050
Yeah.
记得。

617
00:28:19.290 --> 00:28:20.750
I don't remember an accident.
我不记得有什么意外。

618
00:28:21.550 --> 00:28:21.890
Yeah.
是啊。

619
00:28:22.390 --> 00:28:28.850
Randy shared that Ryan ran past the speed meter and it didn't go well.
兰迪分享说瑞安跑过测速仪时，结果不太妙。

620
00:28:29.600 --> 00:28:30.150
Oh, no.
噢，不。

621
00:28:30.710 --> 00:28:34.310
So I reached out to Ryan to get the story.
所以我联系了瑞安想了解一下情况。

