this scene over two different days from three different locations.
在两天内从三个不同的地点拍摄这场戏。

1336
01:02:01.950 --> 01:02:04.050
First, we shot in the
首先，我们在停车场拍摄了

1337
01:02:04.050 --> 01:02:06.310
parking lot with Rain and Ed.
雷恩和艾德的部分。

1338
01:02:06.670 --> 01:02:08.390
They performed the whole thing.
他们表演了全过程。

1339
01:02:08.390 --> 01:02:09.510
We shot it.
我们把它拍了下来。

1340
01:02:09.690 --> 01:02:11.290
And the rest of us
而我们其他人

