were upstairs in Paul's office looking out that window and the camera could whip up to us.
在楼上保罗的办公室里往窗外看，摄像机可以迅速转到我们这边。

1342
01:02:17.710 --> 01:02:18.730
In real time.
实时拍摄。

1343
01:02:18.910 --> 01:02:19.750
In real time.
实时拍摄。

1344
01:02:20.030 --> 01:02:20.190
Yes.
是的。

1345
01:02:20.190 --> 01:02:21.370
