but Dean was shouting out all the action that had happened the day before.
但迪恩一直在大声描述前一天发生的所有动作。

1357
01:02:57.090 --> 01:02:57.270
Right.
没错。

1358
01:02:57.630 --> 01:03:01.690
He said this was the moment when being an editor on the show really helped him.
他说，作为本剧剪辑师的经历在这一刻真的帮了他大忙。

1359
